            "review_title": "Review at Banh Xeo Sau Phuoc",
            "review_text": "XinSyan\nSingapore, Singapore169 contributions\n0\nHidden Gem away from Old Quarter\nNov 2019 • Solo\nIt takes a bit of a walk from most hotels in old quarter but it totally worth the hassle to get here.\n\nThe banh xeo is crispy and tasty, and so their grilled meat skewer. \n\nThe price is very reasonable and during my visit, the patrons were almost entirely the local families which says a lot of its authenticity.\nRead more\nWritten November 1, 2019",
