            "review_text": "True Vietnam - Gorgeous Local Experience\nHanoi, Vietnam129 contributions\n1\nThe true \"Banh xeo\" in Hanoi\nAug 2019\nThis restaurant is one of the best places for banh xeo in Hanoi. The old address is on Le Van Huu street. Now they moved to Cau Dat street. The owner make the banh xeo by himself. It's delicious and very cheap.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 13, 2019",
