            "review_text": "MisterUst\nLondon, United Kingdom60 contributions\n0\nWorth the visit\nJul 2019 • Solo\nExcellent Bianh Xeo. The restaurant specialises in this dish, there are only two food items on the menu and everything else is just drinks. It took 2 minutes to prepare and one of the workers who spoke English explained to me how to put everything together to layer it inside the rice paper.\n\nIt’s a bit of a walk (10-15 minutes) from the main old town area but definitely worth the visit.\nRead more\nWritten July 23, 2019",
